  "notes": "Rates need a Y membership: $298 per week for a youth program member, $263 for a full member. Traditional camp only (K to 8). No swimming at this branch. Camp 8:30 am to 5 pm. A $50 non-refundable deposit per week goes toward tuition; weeks 1 to 5 are due May 15 and weeks 6 to 10 by June 6. Campers bring lunch and two snacks; the Y provides no food. 4Cs and Program for Parents subsidies accepted. Early bird: pay in full for 5 or more weeks in December to keep the prior year's rate.",
